{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 2360566,
  "courseSlug": "sveltejs-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Svelte.js - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14689618",
      "title": "Using Slot Props",
      "lectureOrder": 64,
      "videoOrder": 56,
      "sourceHash": "c5ec7d20cb0f39673fc41cf2509b80b6ad22b755230cd5ea79b2afaee7661c86",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.01,
          "end": 11.46,
          "en": "Now, an advanced scenario could be that you want to control data that you pass into a component into",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 11.46,
          "end": 14.55,
          "en": "a slot from inside that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.58,
          "end": 20.07,
          "en": "Now, what could be an example, for example, and that's of course a bit made up, but let's say we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.07,
          "end": 24.54,
          "en": "had a div in here which holds a disclaimer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.68,
          "end": 26.91,
          "en": "Where we say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.68,
          "end": 32.69,
          "en": "Before you close, you need to agree to our terms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 33.2,
          "end": 38.87,
          "en": "Then here we have a button where we say Agree and we need to press this button here before we actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.87,
          "end": 41.1,
          "en": "enable the close button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.12,
          "end": 44.99,
          "en": "Now, of course, for the default button, we can easily handle this from inside the modal because it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 44.99,
          "end": 45.97,
          "en": "is inside of the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 45.98,
          "end": 50.51,
          "en": "But what about the footer content passed into from outside?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.11,
          "end": 53.78,
          "en": "So here, first of all, we need a new variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 54.35,
          "end": 55.01,
          "en": "Agreed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.01,
          "end": 56.96,
          "en": "And that is false initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 57.02,
          "end": 59.54,
          "en": "And when this button here is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 63.78,
          "en": "Then I set agreed to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 64.36,
          "en": "True.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 64.38,
          "end": 70.71000000000001,
          "en": "So this is the part where I now want to enable this button, which is easy, but also potentially enable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "a button that lives outside of this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 74.76,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "So for this button we simply set disabled here equal to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 81.23,
          "end": 82.37,
          "en": "Not agreed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 82.37,
          "end": 85.03999999999999,
          "en": "If you didn't agree yet, then this is disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 85.52,
          "end": 88.37,
          "en": "Now let me show this with the default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 88.37,
          "end": 91.07,
          "en": "So let's comment out this custom button here first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 91.5,
          "end": 92.27000000000001,
          "en": "Now show the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 92.27000000000001,
          "end": 93.44,
          "en": "This is disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.47,
          "end": 96.22999999999999,
          "en": "If I click agree, it's enabled and now I can close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.22999999999999,
          "end": 97.64,
          "en": "I want to have the same behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.64,
          "end": 103.31,
          "en": "If I do pass in my own data and for that I need to pass data back from inside the modal to the parent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.31,
          "end": 104.66,
          "en": "component where I use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.02000000000001,
          "end": 108.11,
          "en": "And Svelte has a special syntax for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.2,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "On the modal component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 117.78,
          "en": "So in the place where we use the modal, we can get access to variables that we manage inside of the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 118.02000000000001,
          "en": "modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.02000000000001,
          "end": 125.16,
          "en": "So inside of the component to which we pass data into its slots, you get access to this with the special",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 125.16,
          "end": 132.48,
          "en": "Let directive that is a syntax understood by svelte, then a colon and then a name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 132.72,
          "end": 138.48,
          "en": "And the name has to be defined here in the component that has the slots on the slot itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 138.48,
          "end": 145.44,
          "en": "So here on this footer slot where I want to pass the information back here, we could name it did agree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 145.44,
          "end": 148.74,
          "en": "the name is up to you and the value is agreed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 148.74,
          "end": 154.29,
          "en": "So the value is the value of this agreed variable in the modal component and I'm passing this into a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 154.29,
          "end": 155.88,
          "en": "did agree prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 155.88,
          "end": 162.57,
          "en": "However, a slot of course has no prop, but it's funneled back to the parent component by svelte.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 162.57,
          "end": 170.38,
          "en": "And here we can now extract it after the colon of let on the component that has the slot did not agree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 171.49,
          "end": 173.92000000000002,
          "en": "Okay, so here we get access to the value of the degree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 173.92000000000002,
          "end": 179.14,
          "en": "And now on the right side of the equal sign, we store that in a new variable which is now defined in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 179.14,
          "end": 180.07,
          "en": "the parent component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 180.07,
          "end": 187.18,
          "en": "So in the app svelte file here, we could have a new variable Closable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 189.11,
          "end": 190.85,
          "en": "Which initially is false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 193.42,
          "end": 195.01,
          "en": "And want to set this to true here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 195.01,
          "end": 197.14,
          "en": "So I bind closable to did agree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 197.14,
          "end": 199.94,
          "en": "And if we did agree closable becomes true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 199.96,
          "end": 202.27,
          "en": "Now this button here should be disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 202.27,
          "end": 204.4,
          "en": "Therefore I add the disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 205.07999999999998,
          "end": 208.74,
          "en": "Attribute if it's not closable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 210.46,
          "end": 213.61,
          "en": "We now save that and I show that model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 213.61,
          "end": 215.47,
          "en": "You see, it's disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 215.5,
          "end": 217.6,
          "en": "If I click agree, it's enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 217.87,
          "end": 221.14,
          "en": "Now this flow can be complex to wrap your head around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 221.17000000000002,
          "end": 226.99,
          "en": "It's a way of passing data back from the component that has the slots to the component that uses the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 226.99,
          "end": 227.8,
          "en": "slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 227.89,
          "end": 231.54,
          "en": "So here modal component is the component that has the slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 231.55,
          "end": 236.66,
          "en": "And for this slot, the footer slot, we want to pass back information to the parent component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 236.68,
          "end": 241.99,
          "en": "Hence we add a normal property to the slot element, which of course doesn't really accept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 241.99,
          "end": 247.72,
          "en": "That name is the only property the slot normally takes and that therefore is also a reserved property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 247.75,
          "end": 251.29,
          "en": "name, but did agree is normally not understood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 251.41,
          "end": 257.2,
          "en": "But we can extract the value which we do pass to the degree which in this case is the value stored in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 257.2,
          "end": 258.82,
          "en": "the agreed property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 258.85,
          "end": 265.45,
          "en": "We can extract that value in the place where we do pass data into that footer slot, which here is the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 265.45,
          "end": 266.47,
          "en": "app svelte file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 266.5,
          "end": 272.75,
          "en": "Here I'm passing data into the footer slot and there we extract this on the overall component, so not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 272.78,
          "end": 278.18,
          "en": "on the element that receives the footer slot, but on the overall component that has the slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 278.18,
          "end": 281.63,
          "en": "So the modal component with the special let directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 281.65999999999997,
          "end": 286.58,
          "en": "Then the name of the property we used on one of the slots in that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 286.58,
          "end": 290.03,
          "en": "So here on this slot in the modal component, we use the degree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 290.06,
          "end": 296.54,
          "en": "So I can extract it by that name and then bind it to a new variable which is managed inside of the parent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 296.54,
          "end": 297.05,
          "en": "component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 297.05,
          "end": 301.49,
          "en": "So inside of the app component here, the Closable component and the Closable variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 301.49,
          "end": 306.29,
          "en": "And now we can use that Closable variable just as before anywhere in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 306.29,
          "end": 309.56,
          "en": "And here I'm using it to enabling or disabling this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 309.59,
          "end": 317.36,
          "en": "This is how this works and slot props are a very useful feature which you definitely should be aware",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 317.36,
          "end": 324.77,
          "en": "of because they aren't use that often probably, but they allow you to build very powerful things.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
